---
source: fixture/src/lib.rs
---
the source
  version            the files on disk
  has                snapshot
  lacks              history, so page.date is not taken from it
the site
  site.root          `notes/`                 because notes is there
  site.layout        flat                     by default
notes/kettle.md
  file.ignore        kept                     by default
notes/tea.md
  file.ignore        kept                     by default
notes/kettle.md
  page.publish       published                by default
  page.kind          a page                   by default
  page.title         “Kettle”                 from the heading of notes/kettle.md, bytes 0..8
  page.date          undated                  by default
  page.updated       never updated            by default
  page.slug          `kettle`                 from the name of notes/kettle.md
  page.tags          no tags                  by default
  page.summary       “Descale it with vinegar. Related: tea.” from the text of notes/kettle.md
notes/tea.md
  page.publish       published                by default
  page.kind          a page                   by default
  page.title         “Tea”                    from the heading of notes/tea.md, bytes 0..5
  page.date          undated                  by default
  page.updated       never updated            by default
  page.slug          `tea`                    from the name of notes/tea.md
  page.tags          no tags                  by default
  page.summary       “Water just off the boil. See kettle.” from the text of notes/tea.md
the site
  site.home          a generated listing      by default
  site.title         “notes”                  because notes is there
  site.description   none                     by default
  site.authors       no one                   by default
  site.language      `en`                     by default
  site.nav           notes/kettle.md, notes/tea.md by default
